/* Characterization corpus for hmi_config_parse.
 *
 * Prints, for each case, the accept/reject verdict, the exact error text and
 * every field of the parsed structure. The output is compared byte for byte
 * with tests/hmi/config_golden.txt, which was generated by the hand-written
 * parser before it was replaced by a table-driven one. Any change in what is
 * accepted, rejected, or in the message text shows up as a diff.
 *
 * Usage: config_golden            (prints the dump)
 */
